<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#C4Diagram> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#C4Diagram> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A source-backed architectural view of a selected focus at system-context, container, component or code level, tied to a PublishedKnowledgeSnapshot and showing the evidence and gaps relevant to that view." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#C4Diagram> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C4Diagram" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#CodificationAssociation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#CodificationAssociation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An explicitly recorded association identifying a published relationship as a codification of a runtime relationship while preserving both records and their provenance. It is not an equivalence assertion between endpoint entities." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#CodificationAssociation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "CodificationAssociation" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#ImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#ImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An architect-authored, reviewable account of the likely effects of a change request across participating sources, identifying assessed elements, reasons, evidence, source revisions and unresolved gaps. It does not approve the request." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#ImpactAssessment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ImpactAssessment" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#KnowledgeAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#KnowledgeAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Persistent human-authored context attached to an identified published entity, such as a business explanation, way of working or descriptive business RBAC information; it retains runtime provenance." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#KnowledgeAnnotation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "KnowledgeAnnotation" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#KnowledgeContributionChange> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#KnowledgeContributionChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A retained record of a successful creation, edit or removal of a runtime annotation or relationship, preserving its identity, acting user, time and affected content and provenance." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#KnowledgeContributionChange> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "KnowledgeContributionChange" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#PublishedKnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#PublishedKnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An identifiable published baseline of source-owned knowledge, recording the participating source revisions against which entities and relationships are resolved." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#PublishedKnowledgeSnapshot> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PublishedKnowledgeSnapshot" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#RuntimeRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#RuntimeRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A persistent human-authored relationship between identified published entities, with stated meaning and runtime provenance, usable independently of repository codification." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#RuntimeRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "RuntimeRelationship" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The enterprise-wide staff number issued by the HR system and used as the internal primary key by older enterprise systems. Exactly 7 characters: U or N followed by 6 digits, case-insensitive and normalised to uppercase. Unique per member of staff, never reissued and never changed. The identity provider is its source of truth; applications read it from a token claim and do not edit it." <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "StaffId" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#StaffId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology-kit.dev/schema#ValueObject> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#_meta> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> <urn:division-ontology:core> .
<https://github.com/jamiemitchellconsultants/division-ontology#_meta> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.3.0" <urn:division-ontology:core> .
